    "Social offers its users uploads up to %1$s, but PHP refuses anything over %2$s (upload_max_filesize %3$s, post_max_size %4$s). An upload between the two is refused before this app can say why, and the person is told nothing useful. Raise both PHP values, or lower Social's own limit in Administration → Social → Server." : "Social offers its users uploads up to %1$s, but PHP refuses anything over %2$s (upload_max_filesize %3$s, post_max_size %4$s). An upload between the two is refused before this app can say why, and the person is told nothing useful. Raise both PHP values, or lower Social's own limit in Administration → Social → Server.",
