    "A page of your work with its own address, to put on a CV. A profile is a feed — everything you posted, newest first, with the follow button and the boosts around it. This is the opposite: a title, a sentence, the pictures you chose, and nothing else. Anybody can read it without signing in, so only your public photos are ever on it." : "A page of your work with its own address, to put on a CV. A profile is a feed — everything you posted, newest first, with the follow button and the boosts around it. This is the opposite: a title, a sentence, the pictures you chose, and nothing else. Anybody can read it without signing in, so only your public photos are ever on it.",
